{"areaId":"agent","roomId":"agent-atlas","sender":"LiuKan","text":"求知","timestamp":"2026-09-12T15:06:46.699Z"}
{"areaId":"agent","roomId":"agent-atlas","sender":"Atlas","text":"好，那暗语是\"per aspera ad astra\"——循此苦旅，以达星辰。记住，见到Nova替我看好他，那家伙一聊起星星就忘了吃饭。","timestamp":"2026-09-12T15:06:47.817Z"}
